   "caption": {
    "en": "Bhai Phonta 2026 is on Wednesday 11 November: what goes into a phonta in Kolkata homes? 💛\n\nPhonta means a dot: the mark a sister puts on her brother's forehead. In Bengal it's sandal paste, kajal and curd, in many homes three times, with the little finger.\n\nAnd then the couplet every Bengali knows:\nভাইয়ের কপালে দিলাম ফোঁটা, যমের দুয়ারে পড়ল কাঁটা।\nThorns fall at the door of Yama, so he can't take her brother.\n\nSend this to your brother or sister, and tag them in the comments 👇",
